# generated binaries — never commit these.
# The CV PDFs are built by scripts/restore-cv.mjs from the ASCII Base64 sources
# in scripts/cv-b64/, and verified against scripts/cv-manifest.json. Committing
# the PDFs themselves is what destroyed them: a binary carried through a
# text-only channel comes out with every non-UTF-8 byte replaced by EF BF BD.
# The Base64 sources are 7-bit ASCII and survive that channel intact.
public/cv/*.pdf
